<%--
Size_Cap_Component - leaf component used to drive Jqhtml_Local_Storage.set() through the
1MB entry-size cap (local-storage.ts ~622-640).

ARGS: (none - cache key comes from cache_id(), not args, so it stays fixed across phases)

DATA:
    this.data = {tag: 'init'|'small'|'big', length: <serialized payload length>, payload: <string>}

Note: the template deliberately does NOT render this.data.payload into the DOM. That keeps the
rendered HTML tiny even when this.data.payload is >1MB, which is what lets the test distinguish
"data" cache mode (caps based on this.data size) from "html" cache mode (caps based on the
rendered HTML string size).
--%>
<Define:Size_Cap_Component>
  <div $sid="tag"><%= this.data.tag %></div>
  <div $sid="length"><%= this.data.length %></div>
</Define:Size_Cap_Component>
